    5  There is a long post-partum sex taboos and rudimentary contraception
    6  There is a long post-partum sex taboos and the woman practices some intentional form of contraception
    7  The woman is primarily responsible for contraception, e.g., she has knowledge of rites she can perform to prevent offspring or she has knowledge of rites she can perform to prevent offspring or she swallows a drug

